ind":"announcement","title":"Bilge Rats Joins the Steam Next Fest!!","summary":"Steam Next Fest Begins!Download the Bilge Rats demo now to check out its first day. You get to sail around by yourself or with friends. Get to complete the first 3 jobs of the game and get to play liars dice in the tavern or on your ship.The demo is just a slice that Bilge Rats has to offer with the full game containing:Over 80 unique jobsSeveral full cosmetic sets for your ship, tools and playerFully cooperative play with up to 4 friends!Lots of random ocean and island eventsAnd much more...We ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:04:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075310-1846651706672868","game_id":"steam-5075310","kind":"announcement","title":"Liar's Dice comes to the demo. See you all at Next Fest!","summary":"See You at the Steam Next FestBilge Rats is part of Steam Next Fest this October, from the 19th to the 26th. We hope to see you all there. The demo is free and already out, so there's no need to wait for the fest to start.New in the Demo: Liar's DiceWe've updated the demo with one more thing from the full game: the dice table.The Gambler's tableYou'll find the Gambler at the round table in the tavern. Pull up a stool and he'll play you on your own, or bring your crew. There's room for four of yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:21:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075310-1846018067928143","game_id":"steam-5075310","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You to All Those Who Played so Far! And What's New in the Demo","summary":"Thank You!A big thank you to everyone who's played the Bilge Rats demo so far, and to everyone who's taken the time to tell us what they thought. We read all of it.What's New in the DemoWe've brought a few things over from the full game. It's still the first day with the tutorial jobs, but there's a lot more to do while you're out there. To name a few:Fishing - Grab the rod from the barrel in the bilge, cast off the side and reel your catch in by playing along to a sea shanty. You can sell what ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T02:54:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075310-1845383656376816","game_id":"steam-5075310","kind":"announcement","title":"The Bilge Rats Demo is Out Now!","summary":"The Demo is Out NowThe Bilge Rats demo is live on Steam! It's also the build we're taking into Steam Next Fest, so if you found us through the festival, welcome aboard.It covers the first day of the game on the first debt, the tutorial day. You wake up in Crook's Haven owing money, take the starter jobs off the board, and sail out to earn it back. Try to make it home before the evening storm starts putting holes in the hull and send you and your ship to the depths.What's in itThe first in-game d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T09:04:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5075310-1844115010490813","game_id":"steam-5075310","kind":"announcement","title":"The Bilge Rats demo sets sail at the end of September","summary":"The Demo is Nearly HereThe Bilge Rats demo goes live on Steam at the end of September, a little ahead of Steam Next Fest.It's the first day of the game, start to finish. You wake up in Crook's Haven owing money, pull a few jobs off the board, and take the ship out to earn it back. Then you try to get home before the evening storm starts putting holes in the hull. That last part is usually where the chaos starts!What's in itOne full in-game day containing the tutorial day jobs, roughly 15 to 20 m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T04:14:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5075310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5075310":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5075310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:02Z"},"5113840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:03Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5075310","app_id":5075310,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:23Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1d226b616a8c9d263326e6f702d02b919064d8844681b24a1b8167be52d0be01","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A 1-4 player co-op sailing game. Crew a ship out of Crook's Haven, take the work nobody sensible 